Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Duck volume on transient audio focus loss instead of
 ignoring focus

Adds DuckingAudioFocus: requests focus on play, lowers volume to 25% on
transient loss (e.g. phone call), restores on gain, pauses on permanent loss.
